    "description": {
      "content": "The Race Entry Software API was designed for Director software and timing integrations. It provides programmatic access to events, registrations, participants, teams, results, check-in PINs, club memberships, and event creation flows. Authentication is performed via login to obtain a temporary key and secret that expire after 48 hours.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kin Lane\n Email: kin@apievangelist.com",
